---
// Unbuffered vs buffered channels, select multiplexing, sync.Mutex for shared state, and context timeouts.
const W = 900;
const H = 286;
---
<figure class="gf3c">
  <div class="gf3c-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Coordination tools in Go showing unbuffered versus buffered channels, select with context.WithTimeout deadlines, and sync.Mutex protecting shared counters.">
      {/* Left panel: Channels & select + context */}
      <rect x="14" y="14" width="440" height="258" rx="10" class="gf3c-card" />
      <text x="30" y="42" class="gf3c-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. Channels (Pass Ownership) + select + Context</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Channel (truyền tin) + select + Context Timeout</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="60" width="196" height="68" rx="6" class="gf3c-box" />
      <text x="42" y="80" class="gf3c-b">make(chan T) — Unbuffered</text>
      <text x="42" y="99" class="gf3c-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Synchronous rendezvous:</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Hẹn tay trực tiếp 1-1:</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="42" y="116" class="gf3c-m">sender waits for receiver</text>

      <rect x="240" y="60" width="198" height="68" rx="6" class="gf3c-box is-ok" />
      <text x="252" y="80" class="gf3c-b-ok">make(chan T, 4) — Buffered</text>
      <text x="252" y="99" class="gf3c-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Bounded queue of 4 items;</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Hàng đợi chứa sẵn 4 gói;</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="252" y="116" class="gf3c-m">sender blocks only if full</text>

      <rect x="30" y="138" width="408" height="118" rx="6" class="gf3c-box is-ok" />
      <text x="44" y="158" class="gf3c-b-ok">select {'{'} case v := &lt;-ch: ... case &lt;-ctx.Done(): return {'}'}</text>
      <text x="44" y="178" class="gf3c-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Sender closes channel: close(jobs) ends "for j := range jobs".</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Chỉ bên GỬI được gọi close(ch) để báo hết việc cho vòng range.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="44" y="198" class="gf3c-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Never send to a closed channel (panics!); reading yields 0, false.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Gửi vào channel đã đóng là PANIC ngay; đọc trả về (zero, false).</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="44" y="218" class="gf3c-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• context.WithTimeout auto-closes ctx.Done() when deadline expires.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• context.WithTimeout hết giờ sẽ kích ctx.Done() cứu goroutine kẹt.</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Right panel: When to pick Mutex vs Channel */}
      <rect x="470" y="14" width="416" height="258" rx="10" class="gf3c-card" />
      <text x="486" y="42" class="gf3c-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. Rule of Thumb: Channel vs. sync.Mutex</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Chọn đúng công cụ: Channel hay sync.Mutex?</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="486" y="60" width="384" height="62" rx="6" class="gf3c-box is-ok" />
      <text x="500" y="80" class="gf3c-b-ok">Pick Channel for Work Pipelines &amp; Signals</text>
      <text x="500" y="99" class="gf3c-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Handing off jobs, coordinating results, timeouts &amp; cancellation.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Chia việc worker pool, gom kết quả về 1 nơi, gửi tín hiệu dừng.</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="486" y="132" width="384" height="68" rx="6" class="gf3c-box" />
      <text x="500" y="152" class="gf3c-b">Pick sync.Mutex / atomic for Shared State</text>
      <text x="500" y="171" class="gf3c-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>mu.Lock(); defer mu.Unlock() protecting a cache map or counter.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Khóa gọn map cache hoặc biến đếm dùng chung bằng mu.Lock().</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="500" y="188" class="gf3c-m">Simpler &amp; faster than spinning an actor goroutine just for 1 counter.</text>

      <rect x="486" y="210" width="384" height="46" rx="6" class="gf3c-box is-red" />
      <text x="500" y="230" class="gf3c-b-red">Rule: Always defer cancel() right after WithTimeout</text>
      <text x="500" y="246" class="gf3c-m">Prevents leaked timer goroutines if work finishes early!</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Use channels with select and context.WithTimeout to coordinate worker pipelines cleanly, and reach directly for sync.Mutex (with defer Unlock) when guarding shared in-memory state.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Dùng Channel + select + context.WithTimeout cho luồng truyền việc giữa các goroutine, và dùng thẳng sync.Mutex (kèm defer Unlock) khi nhiều luồng cùng cập nhật một biến hay map dùng chung.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gf3c { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gf3c-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gf3c svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gf3c text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gf3c-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gf3c-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gf3c-box.is-red { stroke: var(--red); fill: var(--red-tint-bg); }
  .gf3c-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gf3c-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gf3c-h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gf3c-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gf3c-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gf3c-b-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gf3c-b-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gf3c-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .gf3c figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
